# NOTE: bot_state.json, equity_log.csv, and trades_log_*.csv are intentionally
# NOT ignored. The GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/bot.yml) runs
# the engine in a fresh, disposable container on every scheduled run - if
# these files aren't committed back to the repo, the bot loses all memory of
# open positions, cooldowns, and history between every single run. They are
# not secrets (no API keys live in them), so committing them is safe.
